      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Your ship has crashed on this small island. \nYou built a camp, but
        the tide is getting dangerously high!\n\n\u2022 Gather       to make a camp
        on higher grounds\n\u2022 Collect       to feed your crew at each high tide\n\u2022
        Ring the       to warn your crew about the next tide\n\u2022 Find enough
        resources to rebuild a ship, and save yourself for good !"
